                    "id": "architecture_html",
                    "elType": "widget",
                    "settings": {
                        "html": "<div class='cc-arch-section'>\n    <div class='cc-grid-bg'></div>\n    <div class='cc-arch-container'>\n        <div class='cc-arch-grid'>\n            <div class='cc-arch-image-col cc-reveal'>\n                <div class='cc-image-wrapper'>\n                    <img src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518837695005-2083093ee35b?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop' alt='Healing Space'>\n                </div>\n                <div class='cc-image-accent'></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class='cc-arch-content-col cc-reveal cc-delay-1'>\n                <span class='cc-subtitle'>Our Approach</span>\n                <h2 class='cc-title'>A sacred year of<br><span class='cc-italic'>personalized</span> healing.</h2>\n                <p class='cc-text'>Your life is full. Your recovery shouldn't require another commute, another appointment to rush to, or another unfamiliar space.</p>\n                <p class='cc-text'>We believe the nervous system regulates most deeply in environments where it already feels safe. By bringing the practice to your home, we remove the friction of travel, allowing you to seamlessly integrate deep rest into your actual living space.</p>\n                \n                <div class='cc-stats-row'>\n                    <div class='cc-stat'>\n                        <div class='cc-stat-num'>12</div>\n                        <div class='cc-stat-label'>Months</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class='cc-stat-divider'></div>\n                    <div class='cc-stat'>\n                        <div class='cc-stat-num'>11</div>\n                        <div class='cc-stat-label'>Home Visits</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class='cc-stat-divider'></div>\n                    <div class='cc-stat'>\n                        <div class='cc-stat-num'>1</div>\n                        <div class='cc-stat-label'>Sound Bath</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.cc-arch-section {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n}\n\n.cc-grid-bg {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(14, 27, 48, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 40px 40px;\n    z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.cc-arch-container {\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 40px;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n}\n\n.cc-arch-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 120px;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.cc-arch-image-col {\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.cc-image-wrapper {\n    aspect-ratio: 4/5;\n    border-radius: 48px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n}\n\n.cc-image-wrapper img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    transition: transform 4s ease;\n}\n\n.cc-image-wrapper:hover img {\n    transform: scale(1.1);\n}\n\n.cc-image-accent {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: -40px;\n    right: -40px;\n    width: 200px;\n    height: 200px;\n    background: #D9E8EB;\n    border-radius: 32px;\n    z-index: -1;\n}\n\n.cc-subtitle {\n    display: block;\n    color: #688F9D !important;\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n    text-transform: uppercase !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3em !important;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.cc-title {\n    color: #0E1B30 !important;\n    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n    font-size: 48px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.2 !important;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n}\n\n.cc-italic {\n    font-style: italic !important;\n    color: #688F9D !important;\n}\n\n.cc-text {\n    color: rgba(14, 27, 48, 0.6) !important;\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 18px !important;\n    line-height: 1.8 !important;\n    margin-bottom: 32px;\n}\n\n.cc-stats-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 32px;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(14, 27, 48, 0.05);\n    padding-top: 48px;\n    margin-top: 48px;\n}\n\n.cc-stat-num {\n    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n    font-size: 36px !important;\n    color: #0E1B30 !important;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.cc-stat-label {\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 12px !important;\n    text-transform: uppercase !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2em !important;\n    color: rgba(14, 27, 48, 0.4) !important;\n}\n\n.cc-stat-divider {\n    width: 1px;\n    height: 48px;\n    background: rgba(14, 27, 48, 0.05);\n}\n\n/* Animations */\n.cc-reveal {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(30px);\n    animation: cc-fade-up 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n.cc-delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.4s; }\n\n@keyframes cc-fade-up {\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    .cc-arch-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 80px; }\n    .cc-arch-container { padding: 0 24px; }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .cc-subtitle { font-size: 12px !important; }\n    .cc-title { font-size: 32px !important; }\n    .cc-text { font-size: 16px !important; }\n    .cc-stat-num { font-size: 28px !important; }\n    .cc-stat-label { font-size: 10px !important; }\n}\n</style>"
                    },
